# Guard film (docs/BUGS.md 56): the major soldier off the ridge, the same as n_down_turn for the biggest body.
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd fill -6 -60 0 0 -60 0 stone
lens 30
walker termite_major_soldier -4.5 -59 0.5 -90
log down_turn_major
cmd tick freeze
fov 12
follow 0 2.2 -1.6 0 55
go 3 -60 2
burst major_down_turn 130 1
log off
follow off
quit
